---
import Figure from '../Figure.astro';
---
<Figure id="d-cluster-kinds">
<svg viewBox="0 0 760 330" role="img" aria-label="Shared and dedicated clusters: several shared clusters each hold many customers' organizations, each organization pinned to one cluster; a dedicated cluster belongs to one customer; accounts, organizations and cross-app calls never span clusters" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <rect x="0" y="0" width="760" height="330" rx="10" fill="#0f0f16"/>

  <g class="seq-step" style="--step-i:0">
    <rect x="18" y="20" width="228" height="214" rx="12" fill="#10210f" stroke="#3fb950" stroke-width="1.4"/>
    <text x="132" y="42" text-anchor="middle" fill="#3fb950" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="10.5" font-weight="700">shared cluster eu-shared-1</text>
    <text x="132" y="57" text-anchor="middle" fill="#6b6b80" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">nodes Calimero runs · default for new customers</text>
    <rect x="34" y="72" width="196" height="30" rx="7" fill="#10151c" stroke="#58a6ff"/>
    <text x="132" y="91" text-anchor="middle" fill="#58a6ff" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="9">org acme · its apps</text>
    <rect x="34" y="110" width="196" height="30" rx="7" fill="#10151c" stroke="#58a6ff"/>
    <text x="132" y="129" text-anchor="middle" fill="#58a6ff" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="9">org globex · its apps</text>
    <rect x="34" y="148" width="196" height="30" rx="7" fill="#10151c" stroke="#58a6ff"/>
    <text x="132" y="167" text-anchor="middle" fill="#58a6ff" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="9">personal accounts' apps</text>
    <text x="132" y="204" text-anchor="middle" fill="#6b6b80" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">one plan's quotas per account</text>
    <text x="132" y="218" text-anchor="middle" fill="#6b6b80" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">(POST /ops/quotas)</text>
  </g>

  <g class="seq-step" style="--step-i:1">
    <rect x="266" y="20" width="228" height="214" rx="12" fill="#10210f" stroke="#3fb950" stroke-width="1.4"/>
    <text x="380" y="42" text-anchor="middle" fill="#3fb950" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="10.5" font-weight="700">another shared cluster</text>
    <text x="380" y="57" text-anchor="middle" fill="#6b6b80" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">its own system group and K_r</text>
    <rect x="282" y="72" width="196" height="30" rx="7" fill="#10151c" stroke="#58a6ff"/>
    <text x="380" y="91" text-anchor="middle" fill="#58a6ff" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="9">org initech · its apps</text>
    <rect x="282" y="110" width="196" height="30" rx="7" fill="#10151c" stroke="#58a6ff"/>
    <text x="380" y="129" text-anchor="middle" fill="#58a6ff" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="9">org umbrella · its apps</text>
    <text x="380" y="204" text-anchor="middle" fill="#6b6b80" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">an organization lives on one</text>
    <text x="380" y="218" text-anchor="middle" fill="#6b6b80" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">cluster and stays there</text>
  </g>

  <g class="seq-step" style="--step-i:2">
    <rect x="514" y="20" width="228" height="214" rx="12" fill="#231708" stroke="#f0883e" stroke-width="1.4"/>
    <text x="628" y="42" text-anchor="middle" fill="#f0883e" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="10.5" font-weight="700">dedicated cluster</text>
    <text x="628" y="57" text-anchor="middle" fill="#6b6b80" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">one customer's nodes and plan</text>
    <rect x="530" y="72" width="196" height="30" rx="7" fill="#10151c" stroke="#58a6ff"/>
    <text x="628" y="91" text-anchor="middle" fill="#58a6ff" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="9">the customer's orgs</text>
    <rect x="530" y="110" width="196" height="30" rx="7" fill="#10151c" stroke="#58a6ff"/>
    <text x="628" y="129" text-anchor="middle" fill="#58a6ff" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="9">and their apps</text>
    <text x="628" y="190" text-anchor="middle" fill="#6b6b80" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">governance may give the operator</text>
    <text x="628" y="204" text-anchor="middle" fill="#6b6b80" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">release approvals, upgrades or</text>
    <text x="628" y="218" text-anchor="middle" fill="#6b6b80" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">outbound (fixed at genesis)</text>
  </g>

  <g class="seq-step" style="--step-i:3">
    <rect x="18" y="252" width="724" height="62" rx="10" fill="#161b22" stroke="#444c56" stroke-dasharray="5 4"/>
    <text x="380" y="274" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="9.5" font-weight="700">every cluster is self-contained</text>
    <text x="380" y="292" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b949e" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8.5">accounts, passkeys, sessions, organizations and the app directory live in its system group;</text>
    <text x="380" y="306" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b949e" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8.5">xcalls, aliases and API keys reach only apps on the same cluster</text>
  </g>
</svg>
</Figure>
